  at        11 cm beyond lever pivot, 55 cm up
  friction  0.72
  bounce    dead

domino pedestal
  is a      box 12 by 12 by 2 cm
  at        46 cm behind lever pivot, 49 cm up
  friction  0.72
  bounce    dead

